  "why_it_matters": "`requestedBy.plexId` is on every request, and it is the same number as `users.plex_account_id` \u2014 so a request maps to a Shortlist person with no name matching. `request.status` 5 (COMPLETED) is set by Seerr itself when the media lands (MediaSubscriber.updateRelatedMediaRequest); for a TV request it is set only when EVERY requested season is AVAILABLE, and each `seasons[].status` flips to 5 as that season lands. `media.mediaAddedAt` is when Plex first saw the title; `lastSeasonChange` when a season last changed. There is no title on `media` \u2014 TMDB id is the identity."
